# Custom theme tokens #custom-theme-tokens

:::style
:root {
  --nodx-color-primary: #7c2d12;
  --nodx-color-accent: #1d4ed8;
  --nodx-font-heading: Georgia, serif;
  --nodx-page-margin: 18mm;
}
h1, h2 { color: var(--nodx-color-primary); }
aside { border-inline-start-color: var(--nodx-color-accent); }
.decision { background: #eff6ff; }
:::style

::note {.decision type="tip"}
Theme tokens are regular CSS custom properties after sanitization. Documents can override tokens without requiring a custom renderer.
::note
